        "original_id": "4cb45625-c9eb-58aa-9e8a-9fdfcae8b645",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Cacareco, Cornelius the First\n- Organizations: Rhinoceros Party of Canada\n- Places: Canada\n- Topics: political parties, candidacy inspiration\n\nFacts:\n- Cacareco's candidacy inspired the creation of the Rhinoceros Party of Canada.\n- The Rhinoceros Party of Canada was nominally led by the rhinoceros Cornelius the First.\n- The Rhinoceros Party, in French called \"Parti Rhinocéros,\" was a registered political party in Canada from the 1960s to the 1990s.",
